      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "arcane",
        "electricity"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The dragon breathes lightning that deals 5d12 Electricity Damage damage in an 80ft Line (Basic DC 28 Reflex Saving Throw save).</p>\n<p>It can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Desert Thirst",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "arcane"
      ],
      "description": "<p>When casting Create Water, the dragon can attempt to destroy liquid instead of creating it, turning an equal amount of liquid into sand. This destroys liquid magic or alchemical items if they're of a lower level than the dragon (a creature can attempt a DC 26 Will Saving Throw save to protect all liquids in its possession). This doesn't affect the liquids in a creature's body.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Draconic Frenzy",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The dragon makes two claw Strikes and one horns Strike in any order.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Draconic Momentum",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The dragon recharges its Breath Weapon whenever it scores a critical hit with a Strike.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
